---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import pic from "../img/pic.jpg";
import "../styles/home.scss";
import {motion} from "framer-motion";
---

<Layout title="Chiefe Kennedy Izuchukwu">
	<main>
		<div>
			<motion.div initial={{opacity: 0}} viewport={{once: true}}
						whileInView={{opacity: 1, transition:{duration: 1}}} client:only="react">
				<Image src={pic} alt="Chiefe Kennedy Izuchukwu" loading={'eager'}/>
			</motion.div>
			<motion.h1 initial={{opacity: 0, y: 50}} viewport={{once: true}}
					   whileInView={{opacity: 1, y: 0, transition:{delay: 1, duration: .5}}}
					   client:only="react">Chiefe Kennedy Izuchukwu</motion.h1>
		</div>
<br/>
		<motion.div initial={{opacity: 0, x: -100}} viewport={{once: true}}
							   whileInView={{opacity: 1, x: 0, transition:{delay: 1, duration: 1}}} client:only="react">
<h2 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: larger; margin-bottom: 10px;">About Kennedy Izuchukwu Chiefe:</h2>

							   <p>
								I am Kennedy Izuchukwu Chiefe, founder and CEO of <a class="underline" href="https://ckimarketing.vercel.app/" target="_blank">CKIMarketing</a>, a passionate marketer, political science graduate and dedicated philanthropist committed to empowering individuals, businesses and communities across Nigeria.
							   </p>
			<p>
				Born in Lagos, Nigeria, I am the last son and youngest child of Mr. and Mrs. Ifeanyi and Ann Chiefe. My roots run deep in Anambra State specifically Nando in Anambra East LGA , where my family originates. 
				Shortly after my birth, we relocated to Enugu, a move that shaped the early chapters of my life and education. My Educational Journey
			</p>
			<p>
My academic foundation began at High Grade Nursery and Primary School in Lagos. 
Upon moving to Enugu, I completed my primary education at God’s Care Nursery and Primary School, Achara Layout. I pursued my secondary education first at University Secondary School Enugu and later at Julex Comprehensive Secondary School on Awkunanaw Street. These formative years instilled in me discipline, curiosity and a strong sense of community. I earned my Bachelor’s degree in Political Science from Godfrey Okoye University, Thinkers Corner, Enugu. While political science equipped me with deep insights into governance, leadership, and societal development, I discovered my true calling lay in connecting people and creating opportunities. After graduation, I took the bold step of self teaching marketing and sales skills I recognized as powerful tools for real world impact. 
What started as personal study quickly became a passion that aligned perfectly with my lifelong desire to help others.
			</p>

			<p>
National Service and the Birth of CKI Marketing
Following university, I moved to Abuja to serve my country through the National Youth Service Corps (NYSC). That year of service reinforced my commitment to nation building and community upliftment. 
Immediately after completing my service, I officially founded CKI Marketing a company born from the conviction that strategic marketing and authentic storytelling can transform lives and businesses.
			</p>
			<p>
Today, CKI Marketing stands as the culmination of my journey: a blend of academic knowledge, self driven expertise and an unwavering passion for service.
			</p>

<br/>
<h2 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: larger; margin-bottom: 10px;">My Passion and Purpose:</h2>
<p>
	Helping people has always been at the core of who I am. Whether through one on one mentorship, strategic marketing campaigns that help small businesses grow, or large scale community outreach programs, I find joy in creating pathways for others to thrive. 
	My work in philanthropy including active participation in outreach initiatives and community development projects allows me to give back in meaningful ways, especially to the communities that shaped me in Enugu and Anambra.
</p>
<p>	
	As a devoted Christian, my faith continues to guide my values of integrity, compassion and excellence in everything I do.
</p>

<br/>
<h2 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: larger; margin-bottom: 10px;">Looking Forward:</h2>
<p>
	My story is one of resilience, continuous learning, and purposeful action. 
	From the classrooms of Lagos and Enugu to the boardrooms of Abuja and beyond, every step has prepared me for the mission I pursue today: using marketing as a force for good, building stronger communities, and helping individuals and organizations unlock their fullest potential. I am deeply grateful for the long journey so far the challenges, the lessons and the people who have supported me along the way. 
	I remain excited about what lies ahead and committed to creating lasting impact through CKI Marketing and my philanthropic endeavors. Welcome to my world. Let’s build something meaningful together.
</p>
		</motion.div>


		<motion.div initial={{opacity: 0}} viewport={{once: true}}
					whileInView={{opacity: 1, transition:{duration: 1}}}
					client:only="react" className="contacts">
			<p>For all your marketing services</p>
			<div>Call: <a href="tel:+2347039092819">+234-7039092819</a></div>
		</motion.div>
	</main>
</Layout>
